# Cryptid Inspector counts only permanents "you control". Bot2's Hauntwoods Shrieker attacks on turn 4 and its trigger manifests dread for
# Bot2: Grizzly Bears enters face down under Bot2's control, and Bot1's Inspector gets no counter. Bot1 then turns that permanent face up
# with its own Shrieker's ability: it is a permanent Bot2 controls, so the Inspector gets no counter again, even though Bot1 turned
# it up (CR 701.40b, 603.2). The Inspector stays a 2/3.
#
# Turn 1: Moxen pay for the Inspector, Black Lotus for Bot1's Shrieker; turn 2 Bot2's Lotus pays for its own.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
